 style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:125%">Bonus</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:125%">Payment</span></div></td></tr><tr style="height:3pt"><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:700;line-height:125%">Robert Fried, Chief Executive Officer</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">Total Company - Net Sales</span></div></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">30&#160;</span></div></td><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">%</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">$</span></div></td><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">111,997&#160;</span></div></td><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">$</span></div></td><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:7.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:125%">117,891&#160;</span></div></td><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:0 1pt"/><td style="background-color:#dbdbdb;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="margin-bottom:0.08pt;text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-fa